## Required behavior and reproduction

History summaries must count and cut strings as Ruby String#size/ranges do.
Valid supplementary characters must not be split into lone UTF-16 surrogates.
The original algorithm, truncation decisions and ASCII bytes remain the
comparison contract; this does not substitute grapheme counting.

